Note that 
\begin{align*}
q(x) &= 2 \left(x+\frac{1}{2} \right)^2 -1 - \frac{1}{2} = \cos \left( 2 \arccos \left( x+\frac{1}{2} \right) \right)  -\frac{1}{2} 
\implies q^{2016}(x) &= \cos \left( 2^{2016} \arccos \left( x+\frac{1}{2} \right) \right) -\frac{1}{2} .
\end{align*}
Hence,  $q^{2016}(x)=0 \iff \cos \left( 2^{2016} \arccos \left( x+\frac{1}{2} \right) \right)=\frac{1}{2}$ . Thus, 
\begin{align*}
x=-\frac{1}{2}+\cos \left( \frac{\pi+6k\pi}{3 \cdot 2^{2016}} \right); \qquad k = 0, 1, \dots, 2^{2016}-1.
\end{align*}
For this to be negative, we must have  $-\frac{\pi}{3} <  \frac{\pi+6k\pi}{3 \cdot 2^{2016}} < \frac{5\pi}{3} \iff \frac{2^{2016}-1}{6} < k < \frac{5 \cdot 2^{2016}-1}{6}$ . There are  $\boxed{\frac{2^{2017}+1}{3}}$  such values  $k$ .

